-- AC datas : OLD Description : "你已經贏得了我的尊敬以及你同伴們的敬重。你克服了一切挑戰並且展現出你對聯賽戰鬥的卓越技巧。無庸置疑，你已經準備好為了奧格瑪的榮譽對抗其他主城的勇士。$B$B審判者瑪瑞爾‧真心想跟你談談，$n，並且正式宣佈你加入勇士的技擊大賽。", Description AC enUS : "You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of Orgrimmar!$B$BJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, $N, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = '跟銀白聯賽場地的審判者瑪瑞爾‧真心談談。', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'zhTW' AND `ID` = 13736;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "你已經贏得了我的尊敬以及你同伴們的敬重。你克服了一切挑戰並且展現出你對聯賽戰鬥的卓越技巧。無庸置疑，你已經準備好為了暗矛的榮譽對抗其他主城的勇士。$B$B審判者瑪瑞爾‧真心想跟你談談，$n，並且正式宣佈你加入勇士的技擊大賽。", Description AC enUS : "You have earned my respect and the respect of your peers. You defeated all who challenged you and mastered the ways of tournament combat. I have no doubt that you are ready to face down the champions of other cities for the glory of the Darkspear!$B$BJusticar Mariel Trueheart has asked to speak with you, $N, and to formally enter you in the champions' grand melee." ; Wowhead enUS : "Speak with Justicar Mariel Trueheart at the Argent Tournament Grounds."
