-- AC datas : OLD Description : "這本介紹著騎術訓練與購買坐騎的小手冊是維爾瑪‧瓦納姆送來的。$B$B維爾瑪就在提里斯法林地的布瑞爾。", Description AC enUS : "This pamphlet advertising riding training and mount purchases was sent from Velma Warnam.$B$BVelma can be found at Brill in Tirisfal Glades." ; Wowhead enUS : "Return the pamphlet to Velma Warnam at Brill in Tirisfal Glades."
