-- AC datas : OLD Description : "你想做一個可愛符咒手鐲送給穆拉丁‧銅鬚嗎？我相信他會大吃一驚的。$B$B你已經有可愛符咒收集工具組了嗎？", Description AC enUS : "Did you want to make a Lovely Charm Bracelet for the Lord of Ironforge? I'm sure he'd be thrilled.$B$BDo you already have a Lovely Charm Collector's Kit?" ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Present a Lovely Charm Bracelet to Muradin Bronzebeard in Ironforge."
