(9340,'zhTW','大裂縫','在獵鷹哨站的遊俠隊長范瑞要你去獵鷹哨站東邊的大裂縫殺死8個小石鐮掠奪者和3個石鐮突擊隊員。',0),
(9341,'zhTW','銀色黎明外衣',NULL,0),
(9342,'zhTW',NULL,'此任務已經絕版。[Foreman Razelcraz at the mines near Thrallmar wants you to kill 15 Marauding Crust Bursters. The worms have a tendency to attack suddenly from their tunnels below ground.]',0),
(9343,'zhTW','銀色黎明外衣',NULL,0),
(9344,'zhTW',NULL,'此任務已經絕版。[Far Seer Regulkut wants you to track down her student Grelag.  ]',0),
(9345,'zhTW','準備藥膏','收集12份地獄火骨葉植物然後交給斷脊氏族崗哨的格萊克以完成他的藥膏。',0),
(9346,'zhTW',NULL,'此任務已經絕版。[Watch Commander Krunk in Thrallmar wants you to bring him 10 Plump Helboar Carcasses from Starving Helboars.]',0),
