(13524,'zhTW',NULL,'此任務被暴雪標記為過期，無法獲得或完成。[Open the Wooden Cage and help the Freed Alliance Scout escape from Silverbrook.  Report to Lieutenant Dumont when you reach Amberpine Lodge.]',0),
